WEBVTT

00:09:26.204 --> 00:09:30.787
so that you can actually build in
privacy and transparency

00:09:30.787 --> 00:09:36.704
and really bring the benefits back
to those who actually generated the data.

00:09:37.871 --> 00:09:41.412
So I know we are here,
near Silicon Valley,

00:09:41.454 --> 00:09:44.204
so I can see that, I'm sure,
for many of you,

00:09:44.246 --> 00:09:47.621
you will think, "Wow,
I'm not so sure about this.

00:09:47.662 --> 00:09:50.121
I mean, this would just
never scale, right?"

00:09:50.162 --> 00:09:52.954
I've heard this many times.

00:09:52.996 --> 00:09:54.912
And it doesn't, right?

00:09:54.912 --> 00:09:58.371
It doesn't scale like traditional
Silicon Valley companies.

00:09:58.371 --> 00:10:00.454
Well, it kind of does.